        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-493 (ensure controlled execution — Document Classification, Versioning &amp; Taxonomy (PA-88.1).) | - operational: mandatory fields and validation
Owner: Department Records Custodian</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
